{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_MIPS32__"}}----
Intrinsic define set for 32-bit MIPS targets.

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}
	""__FB_MIPS32__""

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define without a value created at compile time for MIPS32 and MIPS32 little-endian targets.  ##[[KeyPgDdfbmips|__FB_MIPS__]]## is defined at the same time.  Test ##[[KeyPgDdFBBigEndian|__FB_BIGENDIAN__]]## if byte order changes a data format or hardware interface.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#ifdef __FB_MIPS32__
	print "32-bit MIPS target"
#endif
%%

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.3

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- ##[[KeyPgDdfbmips|__FB_MIPS__]]##
	- ##[[KeyPgDdfbmips64|__FB_MIPS64__]]##
	- ##[[CompilerOpttarget|Compiler Option: -target]]##

